cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Cite the exact Git Sonar release or Git commit used."
title: "Git Sonar: Git History as Interactive and Printable Art"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Reed
    given-names: "Jonathan R."
repository-code: "https://github.com/JonathanRReed/Git-sonar"
url: "https://gitsonar.jonathanrreed.com/"
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Git Sonar is a browser-based tool for exploring commit history and turning
  repository data into deterministic movie posters, album covers, generative
  prints, and data visualizations. It supports local Git archives, public
  repository URLs, interactive graph navigation, and PNG, SVG, and PDF export.
keywords:
  - Git visualization
  - generative art
  - developer tools
  - local-first
  - data visualization
